[{"title":"闳肃书堂","author":"陈岩","text":"人生随遇是行藏，最有山灵引兴长。\n安得居乡伯休父，再来闳肃旧书堂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17538,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"饮猿潭","author":"陈岩","text":"月照秋空风满林，孤猿渴饮碧潭深。\n我今忘我兼忘物，兀坐怡然不动心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17539,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龟山崇寿院","author":"陈岩","text":"白云起处著招提，一岭嵯峨众岭低。\n多少山间好风景，人来先看蒋公题。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17540,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"净巾石","author":"陈岩","text":"炯炯豁开明镜台，是中无处著尘埃。\n平生心地常如此，何暇频频拂拭来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17541,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"净居院","author":"陈岩","text":"缭白萦青照眼波，芙蓉出没在天河。\n不因云影閒来去，安得春山态度多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17542,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"净信院","author":"陈岩","text":"来自青松翠竹关，秋风吹帽醉醒间。\n纷纷遮眼尘如海，拈起毫端又说山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17543,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"卧云庵","author":"陈岩","text":"乱云堆里酣酣梦，人在清泉白石间。\n胶扰劳生鼎中沸，有官不换此身閒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17544,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"卧牛石","author":"陈岩","text":"石犀沉后波涛息，石燕飞时风雨来。\n堪笑石牛徒解卧，山田无数任蒿莱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17545,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"卧龙庵","author":"陈岩","text":"孔明西去终扶汉，散骑南来莫拯唐。\n同是卧龙殊用舍，古今易地两南阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17546,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"垂云涧","author":"陈岩","text":"飞瀑奔崖色皎然，飘空上下势相连。\n看来不是天河水，尽是兜罗片片绵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17547,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宝陀岩","author":"陈岩","text":"阴磴层崖洞室宽，奇花异草几多般。\n綵云不动金光起，便作金莲法界看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17548,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岩泉","author":"陈岩","text":"月光泉脉泻虚明，澄碧无瑕注一泓。\n大字石间标圣水，只缘彻底是真清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17549,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"招贤峰","author":"陈岩","text":"翘翘车乘力招贤，建业山河五十年。\n欲问兴亡无问处，一声山鸟忽来前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17550,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"斧柯岭","author":"陈岩","text":"偶尔观棋忽烂柯，岂知胜负是如何。\n归来笑问人间事，恰是人间胜负多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17551,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"枕月峰","author":"陈岩","text":"层崖缺处月婵娟，金背虾蟆就石眠。\n笑问月边人在否，中宵有梦到钧天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17552,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"法乐院","author":"陈岩","text":"无住师参第一禅，指开古洞秀岩天。\n东扶西倒都休问，且结人间见在缘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17553,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"祈雨坛","author":"陈岩","text":"万感生于一念间，炷香惊起老龙蟠。\n今年人协嘉鱼梦，荒却池前古石坛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17554,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"罗汉行道峰","author":"陈岩","text":"碧眼禅师锡振空，石头无路不相通。\n俯看尘世三千界，总在空花起灭中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17555,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"罗汉峰","author":"陈岩","text":"阅尽人间万劫尘，平生结习一无存。\n居山更向山头坐，兀兀真成不动尊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17556,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"虎头岩","author":"陈岩","text":"下视眈眈猛若神，世方重利反轻身。\n纵教是虎真非石，藜藿来寻亦有人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17557,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金光洞","author":"陈岩","text":"神剜鬼划剧幽深，门外藤萝浅结阴。\n洞里金仙十年坐，湛然认得本来心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17558,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金地茶","author":"陈岩","text":"瘦茎尖叶带馀馨，细嚼能令困自醒。\n一段山间奇绝事，会须添入品茶经。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17559,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金沙泉","author":"陈岩","text":"金能生水水涵金，本本源源造化心。\n几许碎金随水出，披沙终日若为寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17560,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"青峭湾","author":"陈岩","text":"石涧竹冈无尽时，上难著脚下难窥。\n平生所性佳山水，烟雨中行不废诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17561,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"保真院","author":"陈岩","text":"野寺荒山涧水滨，古藤翠筱自摇春。\n僧閒晏坐无人到，内保禅心一味真。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17562,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南台","author":"陈岩","text":"旧日新罗国里僧，山间散满百千灯。\n只将一嘿消诸妄，坐透禅机最上乘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17563,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南阳涧","author":"陈岩","text":"人家四散占荒丘，晓夜悲鸣涧水流。\n点点寒鸦来不尽，昏云颓日古猷州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17564,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"思贤岩","author":"陈岩","text":"谏稿成埃两鬓丝，考槃在涧倚天知。\n岩前风叶行人耳，便是襄阳堕泪碑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17565,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拱辰峰","author":"陈岩","text":"水合众流同赴海，山分一岭独朝天。\n居高素以谦为德，日月倾心斗极边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17566,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拾宝岩","author":"陈岩","text":"梵王住在光明殿，万宝真同瓦砾看。\n玉块金沙随地有，好来撷取入中单。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17567,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春阳台","author":"陈岩","text":"富贵风吹一鬨埃，春阳留得旧时台。\n老松偃蹇山前立，曾见昔人歌舞来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17568,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"派派泉","author":"陈岩","text":"水源同出万山头，上半支分各自流。\n曲折绕从山下去，短莎随地弄轻柔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17569,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"炼丹井","author":"陈岩","text":"閒中惟有高低枕，老去宁无内外丹。\n千载稚川今往矣，谁言古井不生澜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17570,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"独秀峰","author":"陈岩","text":"一山夐出众山中，日照烟浮紫翠浓。\n山不争高人共仰，几多丘垤俨相从。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17571,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"狮子行道峰","author":"陈岩","text":"佛力所至物皆化，看取南山金碧堆。\n林浮莽伏不衔毒，狮子昔曾行道来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17572,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"狮子峰","author":"陈岩","text":"懒上维摩室里床，却来山顶现毫光。\n纷纷百兽俱驯伏，薝卜春风到处香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17573,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"神光岭","author":"陈岩","text":"眼看恒河几劫沙，随身锁子骨钩加。\n岭头闪闪神光动，无尽灯中转法华。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17574,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"茗地源","author":"陈岩","text":"暖风吹长紫芽茎，人向山头就水烹。\n陆羽傥曾经此地，谷帘安得擅佳名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17575,"s