title":"笑指亭","author":"陈岩","text":"多少人间狭路偏，山川还是旧山川。\n淡然忘笑兼忘指，嘿嘿真成第一禅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17582,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"莲花庵","author":"陈岩","text":"冷屋栖云是几年，嗔人履迹破苔钱。\n不辞更入山深处，手种西方社里莲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17583,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"资圣庵","author":"陈岩","text":"朝暮相依五老仙，鸟啼花落几何年。\n尘劳不到山深处，窗外日高人尚眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17584,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"逍遥台","author":"陈岩","text":"拂面溪风洒洒清，轻衫短帽御风行。\n逍遥自是天游乐，不结沙鸥水石盟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17585,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"透碧岩","author":"陈岩","text":"空洞玲珑万石攒，中间逗入翠光寒。\n人来坐对山无语，表里虚明不碍观。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17586,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"钵盂峰","author":"陈岩","text":"农家辛苦靳逢年，谁似僧家饱饭眠。\n留得巾盂为老伴，丰年常在粥盂边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17587,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"高僧石","author":"陈岩","text":"柏根翻动一炉香，白足高僧礼梵王。\n还了十方行脚债，却来山顶放圆光。","collection":"宋","not