efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谏堂山","author":"陈岩","text":"茸茸莎草袅风长，二百年前一谏堂。\n旧地几番新地主，谏堂名字愈辉光。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17601,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"野螺峰","author":"陈岩","text":"野螺倒向空中立，回旋萦成翠甲长。\n沬雾濡云真得计，鱼虾旧侣莫相忘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17602,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄石溪","author":"陈岩","text":"平田千亩万山中，水脉高低处处通。\n黄石一溪三十里，暖风吹动稻花丛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17603,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄匏城","author":"陈岩","text":"草色浓于野烧烟，春风吹面午阴天。\n长江摇荡游人眼，兴在悠悠一雁边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17604,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄粒稻","author":"陈岩","text":"紫芒金粒动秋风，三月腰镰捲地空。\n农事倦时天与力，机舂相继便论功。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17605,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"普贤台","author":"陈岩","text":"石台宿草几年荒，不比维摩狮子床。\n大士向来曾晏坐，是身如电暗回光。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17606,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"曾氏景全亭","author":"陈岩","text":"绿色轩窗四面开，几曾閒却对